{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03108","headline":"故荥阳君苏氏挽歌词三首 三 · 张九龄","name":"故荥阳君苏氏挽歌词三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"缟服纷相送，玄扃翳不开。\n更悲泉火灭，徒见柳车回。\n旧室容衣奠，新茔拱树栽。\n唯应月照簟，潘岳此时哀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03108.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03108","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}